      "YOUR CONNECTION SCHEDULE\nFlight\n101\n103\n105\n107\n109\n111\n113\n115\n117\n119\n121\n123\n125\n127\n129\n131\n133\n135\n137\n139\n141\nOakland to San Francisco\nSan\nSan\nOakland\nFrancisco\nLV\nAR\n6:10AM\n6:20 AM\n6:50\n7:35\n8:20\n8:55\nSan Francisco to Oakland\nFlight\n102\n104\n106\n108\n110\n112\n114\n116\n118\n120\n122\n124\n126\n128\n130\n132\n134\n136\n138\n140\n142\nSan\nFrancisco\nLV\n6:25AM\n7:05\n7:40\n8:25\n9:00\n9:35\n11:00\n11:45\n12:15PM\n12:45\n1:40\n2:30\n3:30\n4:30\n5:30\n6:30\n7:05\n7:35\n8:05\n9:25\n10:35\nOakland\nAR\n6:35AM\n7:15\n7:50\n8:35\n9:10\n9:45\n11:10\n11:55\n12:25PM\n12:55\n1:50\n2:40\n3:40\n4:40\n5:40\n6:40\n7:15\n7:45\n8:15\n9:35\n10:45\nFrequency\nX6-7\nD\nD\nD\nD\nD\nD\nD\nD\nD\nD\nX6-7\nFrequency\nX6-7\nD\nD\nD\nD\nD\nD\nD\nD\nD\nD\nD\nD\nD\nD\nD\nD\nX6-7\n• AIRPORT LOCATIONS\nSan Francisco\nInternational Airport\nSFO Helicopter\nGATE 74\nDelta\nAmerican\nGolden West\nAir Canada\nAspen\nEastern\nInland Empire\nUnited\nAirCal\nNorth Termina\nCentral Terminal\nSouth Terminal\nCP Air\nPan Am\nInternational Carriers\nSFO Helicopter\nGATE 10\nPSA\nRepublic\nPSA\nContinental\nAlaska\nTWA\nPacific Express\nWestAir\nWestern\nNorthwest\nOAKLAND\nINTERNATIONAL\nAIRPORT\nUnited\nSFO Helicopter\nAmerican\nCONDITIONS OF TRAVEL\nBAGGAGE-Per passenger, two pieces of checked\nbaggage, total length, width, and height of each not to\nexceed 62 inches (157cm), total length, width, and\nheight of both combined not to exceed 107 inches\n(272cm). No piece may weigh over 50 pounds. First\npiece guaranteed space on the scheduled flight; second\npiece on a space available basis.\nEXCESS BAGGAGE CHARGES-In excess of\nbaggage allowance or oversized baggage, $10.00 per\npiece, on a space available basis.\nBAGGAGE LIABILITY—$500.00 per passenger; all\nbaggage claims must be submitted immediately.\nRESTRICTED ARTICLES-Corrosive liquids,\nflammable substances, such as matches and lighter\nfluid, compressed gas or any hazardous material may\nnot be carried in baggage.\nCHECK IN TIME-Passengers must be checked in\nat least ten minutes prior to the scheduled departure\nof the flight, or the reservation may be cancelled.\nRESPONSIBILITIES FOR DEPARTURES,\nARRIVAL, CONNECTIONS AND CANCEL-\nLATIONS-SFO Helicopter Airlines will not be\nresponsible for damages resulting from failure to depart\nor arrive at times stated in the timetable, nor for errors\nherein, nor for failure to make connections with planes\nof other airlines or of this company, nor for cancellations.\nCREDIT CARDS -SFO Helicopter Airlines accepts\nAmerican Express, Diners Club, Carte Blanche,\nMaster Card, VISA and UATP.\nTICKETING-Tickets may be purchased from your\ntravel agent, corporate traffic manager, any scheduled\nairlines, or any SFO HELICOPTER AIRLINES ticket\ncounter.\nCONNECTION TIME-Please allow a minimum\nof 30 minutes to connect with a United flight; 45\nminutes for all other airlines.\nReservations Number: 415/430-8666\nAirline Code FN"
